[01:53] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'or smaller than some threshold. I use this as the selection and then as I get bigger it will be kind of hard to see. Let\'s go up by certain intervals. So as I go to 0.01 we get a few less 002. Now we\'re out of them. 105. There we go. So'

[02:08] [scene:talk]
